  "regression_scope": [
    "Five policies reconstructed from authenticated component files equal independent complete-release derivations, including both toolchains and projected CMake/Ninja payload identities.",
    "SDK input policy requires its build root and both independent toolchain qualification pins. Contract and later roots derive the exact pins from the predecessor chain; mismatched toolchain builds or host runtime/Ninja links fail.",
